{"step_index":443,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-28T03:10:52Z","thinking":"**Analyzing the Inquiry**\n\nI'm currently dissecting the user's question about the insertion of a tax office number into an unexpected cell. I'm focusing on the implied action within the user's observed Excel file. I'm trying to extract the meaning behind \"왜\" and the context.\n\n\n**Investigating the Context**\n\nI believe the user is pointing out instances where a tax office's number, or representative number, has been inserted instead of a direct company phone number, possibly during phone number crawling from sources like Bizno. Alternatively, it might relate to the initial digits of the business registration number, which represents the tax office code. To confirm, I'll be searching the updated data for these phone number patterns. I'm looking for the standard tax office numbers such as 126 or local numbers like 051-xxx-xxxx and regional tax office pattern numbers.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"Inspect if tax office (세무서) numbers/addresses were accidentally inserted into missing fields.\",\"UserFacing\":false}","CodeContent":"\"import openpyxl\\nimport json\\nimport re\\n\\nfinal_excel_path = r\\\"C:\\\\Users\\\\lg\\\\Desktop\\\\오늘\\\\(데이터검증팀)실사_DB_배현명_1000행_전수정제_최종완벽본.xlsx\\\"\\nwb = openpyxl.load_workbook(final_excel_path, data_only=True)\\nws = wb[\\\"실사DB_1000행_전수정제완료\\\"]\\n\\ntax_office_prefixes = [\\n    '051-810-', '051-310-', '051-620-', '051-740-', '051-240-',\\n    '051-559-', '051-580-', '051-460-', '051-780-'\\n]\\n\\nsuspicious_rows = []\\n\\nfor r in range(2, ws.max_row + 1):\\n    vals = [str(ws.cell(r, c).value or '').strip() for c in range(1, 19)]\\n    name = vals[2]\\n    biz_no = vals[3]\\n    ceo = vals[4]\\n    addr = vals[6]\\n    phone = vals[7]\\n    fax = vals[8]\\n    corp_no = vals[13]\\n    \\n    is_tax_office = False\\n    reasons = []\\n    \\n    # Check phone/fax\\n    for pfx in tax_office_prefixes:\\n        if phone.startswith(pfx):\\n            is_tax_office = True\\n            reasons.append(f\\\"전화번호가 세무서 국번({pfx}): {phone}\\\")\\n        if fax.startswith(pfx):\\n            is_tax_office = True\\n            reasons.append(f\\\"팩스번호가 세무서 국번({pfx}): {fax}\\\")\\n            \\n    # Check if '세무서' is in address or name\\n    if '세무서' in addr and '세무서' not in name:\\n        is_tax_office = True\\n        reasons.append(f\\\"주소에 세무서 포함: {addr}\\\")\\n        \\n    if is_tax_office:\\n        suspicious_rows.append((r, name, reasons))\\n\\nprint(f\\\"Total suspicious tax office insertions found: {len(suspicious_rows)}\\\")\\nfor r, name, reasons in suspicious_rows:\\n    print(f\\\"Row {r:4d}: {name:30s} -> {', '.join(reasons)}\\\")\\n\"","Description":"\"Inspect tax office insertions\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\lg\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\6849e270-cdbb-4526-97ab-99f7d77523f7\\\\scratch\\\\check_tax_office.py\"","toolAction":"\"Checking tax office numbers\"","toolSummary":"\"Run check_tax_office.py\""}}]}
